This repository bundles third-party components under their own licenses:

- `driver/LpcIO.bin`, `driver/IntelMSR.bin` — PawnIO modules, LGPL-2.1
  (see `driver/PAWNIO-MODULES-LICENSE.txt`)
- `driver/WinRing0x64.sys` — OpenLibSys 1.2.0, see `refs/vendor/OlsIoctl.h`
- `src/ui/fonts/GeistMono-*.ttf` — SIL Open Font License 1.1
  (see `src/ui/fonts/OFL.txt`)
- `refs/vendor/` — upstream sources kept for reference, each under its own
  license (LibreHardwareMonitor: MPL-2.0; SignalRGB Maxsun plugin: see its
  header). They are not compiled into fan-tune.
